{
  "id": "qud-compare",
  "title": {
    "en": "Quantitative Comparisons",
    "ar": null
  },
  "railLabel": {
    "en": "Quantitative Comparisons",
    "ar": "المقارنات الكمّية"
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "The question type most associated with Qudrat: two quantities, <strong>A</strong> and <strong>B</strong>, and a single decision to make.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● The four responses",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Choose: <strong>A &gt; B</strong>, <strong>A &lt; B</strong>, <strong>A = B</strong>, or <strong>cannot be determined</strong> — the last when the relationship changes depending on unknown values. Always test convenient numbers before deciding.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Here \\( A=2x \\) and \\( B=x+3 \\). Slide \\( x \\): notice the order of A and B <em>flips</em>, so with \\( x \\) unknown the honest answer is \"cannot be determined\".",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · A vs B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "canvasId": "qudCmpCanvas",
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "A number line comparing quantity A equals 2x with quantity B equals x plus 3",
          "ar": null
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "qudCmpDataBtn",
          "panelId": "qudCmpDataPanel",
          "descId": "qudCmpDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "qudCmpDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "Quantity A and B at the current x, and how the relation changes across x",
            "ar": null
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "A = 2x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "B = x + 3",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "relation",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "qudCmpX",
            "valueDisplayId": "qudCmpXV",
            "label": {
              "en": "\\( x \\) =",
              "ar": null
            },
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Value of x",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -5,
            "max": 5,
            "value": 1,
            "step": 1
          }
        ],
        "readouts": [
          {
            "id": "qudCmpA",
            "label": {
              "en": "A = 2x",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "indigo"
          },
          {
            "id": "qudCmpB",
            "label": {
              "en": "B = x + 3",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "amber"
          },
          {
            "id": "qudCmpRel",
            "label": {
              "en": "relationship",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "They are equal at \\( x=3 \\); to the left \\( B \\) leads, to the right \\( A \\) leads.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 5.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<strong>A:</strong> \\( 25\\% \\) of \\( 80 \\). &nbsp; <strong>B:</strong> \\( 20 \\). Compare. \\( 25\\% \\) of \\( 80=20 \\), so \\[ A=B. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 5.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<strong>A:</strong> \\( x \\). &nbsp; <strong>B:</strong> \\( x^{2} \\), for a real number \\( x \\). Compare. If \\( x=\\tfrac12 \\) then \\( B&lt;A \\); if \\( x=2 \\) then \\( B&gt;A \\). Therefore \\[ \\text{cannot be determined.} \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Quantitative comparison strategy",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Each QC question gives two quantities, A and B. You choose: A&gt;B, B&gt;A, A=B, or cannot be determined. Plug in special values (0, 1, −1, fractions) to test.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Strategy 1",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Simplify both columns algebraically before comparing",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Strategy 2",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Plug in 0, 1, −1, ½ to check if relationship is constant",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Strategy 3",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "If a variable could make either column larger: \"cannot determine\"",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Geometry tip",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Draw a diagram; do not assume figures are to scale",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Column A: \\( x^2 \\). Column B: \\( x \\). Compare. If \\( x=2 \\): \\( 4>2 \\). If \\( x=\\frac{1}{2} \\): \\( \\frac{1}{4}<\\frac{1}{2} \\). If \\( x=0 \\): equal. → Cannot be determined.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<strong>Quantity A:</strong> \\((x-3)^2\\) &nbsp; <strong>Quantity B:</strong> \\(x^2-6x+9\\) for any real \\(x\\). Compare. <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>Expand A: \\((x-3)^2=x^2-6x+9.\\) <strong>A = B</strong> (always).</div></details>",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "chapterNumber": "5"
}
